ublic","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117241#pullrequestreview-4022939129","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117241","author_association":"NONE","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117241#pullrequestreview-4022939129"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117241"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-27T18:26:49Z","commit_id":"53cd511aaeb225db7c081514517bef3a21397536"},{"id":4090917826,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7z1nPC","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_ssil.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26635077/test_ssil.zip)\r\n\r\n### Before\r\n\r\n#### Normal\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5ce289cc-bfcb-438c-8ff4-408d5c594807\r\n\r\n#### Ultra\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c4b682b4-2f74-4629-96f2-ac26c42bc3c7\r\n\r\n### After\r\n\r\n#### Normal\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e3a5c970-a545-4653-9c20-d118484caea2\r\n\r\n#### Ultra\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fded556d-e576-4535-9513-6085ec0009bb\r\n\r\nSome feedback:\r\n\r\n- With this PR, the SSIL range becomes resolution-dependent (old SSIL did not have this issue). At higher resolutions, SSIL doesn't go as far:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fd976fdb-a19d-4229-9575-3e4ceaa15f03\r\n\r\nThis also affects toggling the **SSIL > Half Size** project setting. This makes adjustments more difficult, as the appearance effectively varies according to window size and the 3D resolution scale factor. If possible, look into adjusting the SSIL range automatically relative to a base viewport resolution (e.g. 1080 pixels tall).\r\n\r\nIf you manually double the range when the viewport resolution is doubled on each axis, you get roughly the same SSIL appearance:\r\n\r\nHalf resolution | Full resolution | Full resolution, doubled range\r\n-|-|-\r\n<img width=\"1497\" height=\"631\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6c8da664-1a4b-46dc-9f4a-64d6f915d65a\" /> | <img width=\"1497\" height=\"631\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cdd37548-c41d-4bd3-81e0-e7239be54931\" /> | <img width=\"1497\" height=\"631\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aeac8015-3e3b-4f31-8ef3-3ad09e375d0e\" />\r\n\r\n- The default quality leads to rather noisy visuals, especially when strong emissives are involved. To improve quality without affecting performance too much, I suggest reintroducing the noise, but only jitter it every frame when TAA or FSR2 is enabled. Keep the noise static otherwise, which should make it less noticeable.\r\n  - We do something similar for shadow maps already: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/61834\r\n  - Look into using interleaved gradient noise:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9495deaf7532313ff7154d8a06aa6fc100807532/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/environment/sky.glsl#L142-L147\r\n\r\nTAA jitter can be performed by adding a offset every frame, with `taa_frame_count` being equal to `float(RSG::rasterizer->get_frame_number() % p_jitter_phase_count)`:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9495deaf7532313ff7154d8a06aa6fc100807532/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/scene_forward_lights_inc.glsl#L305\r\n\r\n- Backface rejection is now off by default, which likely explains why visuals can change so much in some scenes. It also means indirect lighting can be less temporally stable, especially when faces that are nearly parallel to the camera slowly become visible like the ceiling here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d263505a-88ef-4487-b668-e46a93cb2574","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117241#pullrequestreview-4090917826","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117241","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117241#pullrequestreview-4090917826"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117241"}},"submitted_at":"2026-04-10T16:04:39Z","commit_id":null},{"id":4775918155,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHKq6Sw","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?u=8069d9b7bc6ab503ce83dfcfa53fd021672aeccf&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users